  "base_medium": "Standard M9 minimal medium (Cold Spring Harbor Protocols / Sambrook & Russell) supplemented with sodium pyruvate (5 g/L) as sole organic carbon/energy source, 34 mg/L chloramphenicol, under an elevated CO2 atmosphere (pCO2 = 0.1 atm).",
