   "corrections": [],
   "notes": "The paper (Antonovsky et al., Cell 2016, 'Sugar Synthesis from CO2 in E. coli') and its Supplemental Experimental Procedures use undefined 'M9 minimal media' with no base-medium citation; base-salt concentrations are therefore the canonical M9 recipe. IMPORTANT: neither the paper nor standard M9 includes any trace-element mix (Co, Cu, Mn, Zn) or vitamins/thiamine, so the Co2+/Cu2+/Mn2+/Zn2+/Fe2+/Fe3+ entries in current_components are genome-scale-model open-exchange artifacts (lb -1000), NOT documented recipe compounds, and were intentionally not carried into the recipe. Iron is not specified "
